Libraries bundled with wxWidgets and SDL3
-----------------------------------------
Packages that bundle wxWidgets or SDL3 also carry the shared libraries those
depend on in that build (for example libpng, libjpeg, libtiff, libwebp, zstd,
PCRE2 and xz on macOS). They are unmodified and keep their own permissive
licenses; the file listing of each package shows which ones it contains.
